<title>USA: TENNIS-TUESDAY'S RESULTS AT ATLANTA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TUESDAY'S RESULTS AT ATLANTA.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Georgia 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round results at the $328,000 AT&amp;T Challenge tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First-round</p>
<p>Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) beat 1-Michael Chang (U.S.) 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>2-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Steve Campbell (U.S.) beat 3-Jim Courier (U.S.) 2-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>4-Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Jaime Oncins (Brazil) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>5-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Alejandro Hernandez</p>
<p>(Mexico) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>6-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Bryan Shelton 7-5 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>7-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>2-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Scott Humphries (U.S.) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Mariano Zabaleta (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Johan Van Herk (Belgium) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Dennis van Scheppingen (Netherlands) beat Nicklas Kulti</p>
<p>(Sweden) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Kris Goossens (Belgium) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Jerome Hanquez (France) 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
